Street and east of Duff Avenue), to Schroll Cabinets, Inc., which sale will benefit the economic
development of the municipality pursuant to Wyo. Stat. §15-1-112(b). The estimated appraised
value of said property to be sold is $3,800.00. Upon inquiry, Mayor Kaysen advised the public
hearing item is also affiliated with Agenda Item #14 (Resolution), which identifies the real
property involved contains approximately 3,816 sq. ft.  There being no further comments or
input and purpose of the hearing having been met, Mayor Kaysen closed the hearing.
