for Public Services Committee, Mr. Brown moved to approve on third and final reading,
seconded by Mr. Pierson.  Mr. Brown moved to postpone for two weeks (to Feb. 9, 2009),
seconded by Mr. Pierson.  Motion to postpone carried.  Voting “yes” – all members of the
governing body.
